opulation, total in Iceland: 2025 Data, Chart & History – IndexBox - Population, total in Iceland","url":"https://app.indexbox.io/indicators/symbol/population-total-iceland/#1","encrypted_content":"","page_age":"2026-10-31T16:00:00+00:00","snippet":"Population, total in Iceland Population, total in Iceland rose 1.5% to 392,404 in 2025, the highest in data going back to 1971, according to the World Bank. ... Period: 2025; Value: 392,404; vs previous: ▲ 1.5% ... Period: 2024; Value: 386,506; vs previous: ▲ 0.2%","site_name":"IndexBox","site_icon":"https://cdn.deepseek.com/site-icons/indexbox.io"},{"type":"web_search_result","title":"Iceland Population (1950-2026)","url":"https://www.macrotrends.net/global-metrics/countries/isl/iceland/population","encrypted_content":"pGj1qXThq/u48rdCQcCsl3mkEfTh9NJgU/QUaO71+kQgOhAmo9LuQkrUiHUKjRLmkOoC1+YCAy7NiyiJxp73tSk4CPJgdIVT3sVaUIAnuIQZ9qbvGirTpYSmgxGJhlvjQLnb8mnNv6IfIg1N6OSnueLG6ScdJYq/m38oNyoID1pRq7DtJ3sdGi5e+cBY6TFcElGmqsu/LlMsL5m93pBippRorHyIOayECbN99jzYddnXA0al/7TkRvo=","page_age":"2025-12-31T16:00:00+00:00","snippet":"Total population for Iceland in 2025 was 380,010, a 0.61% increase from 2024. - Total population for Iceland in 2024 was 377,689, a 0.63% increase from 2023.","site_name":"Macrotrends","site_icon":"https://cdn.deepseek.com/site-icons/macrotrends.net"},{"type":"web_search_result","title":"Iceland vs Timor-Leste: Population | HistorySaid","url":"https://historysaid.com/compare/iceland-vs-timor-leste/population/","encrypted_content":"","page_age":"2025-12-31T16:00:00+00:00","snippet":"In 2025, Iceland's population was 394,600 compared to 1.4M in Timor-Leste. Timor-Leste was higher by 1.0M. ... Year: 2025; Iceland: 394,600; Timor-Leste: 1.4M ... Year: 2024; Iceland: 386,506; Timor-Leste: 1.4M","site_name":"Spain GDP per Capita 2003: $21,522 — Up 27.1% | HistorySaid","site_icon":"https://cdn.deepseek.com/site-icons/historysaid.com"},{"type":"web_search_result","title":"Population : Islande - Données Pays - Population : Islande","url":"https://www.universalis.fr/donnees-pays/indicateur/population/islande/#1","encrypted_content":"QcH0swaFREQtX+eD6pn9TMe8f27vmEqLf4LTFL0WLd4787ymU9aNTDRrN/iGMND3OfshbpBS+HNCQESyIx+q8orski66t7FRsqFWtGh9D+FTateE5F7Iq03SxNEPPm0vyAAQCFerB0CbgNyIn7ozx4wccG8SMrza8K3FH9LyJ/Q3MYL7m4PeFdf3t4OrPJrhTBXvGOXh/BMLwL81i0Eam6yVng+1Xhhg2UDsbA==","page_age":null,"snippet":"Islande 392 404 habitants ... La population de l’Islande a évolué de 175 574 habitants en 1960 à 392 404 habitants en 2025. ... 2024 | 2025","site_name":"Encyclopédie Universalis","site_icon":"https://cdn.deepseek.com/site-icons/universalis.fr"},{"type":"web_search_result","title":"Iceland Population","url":"https://www.focus-economics.com/country-indicator/iceland/population/","encrypted_content":"M8fBoEoy7tnk230tktm/5R4ZoY2T1yBFYaQvSvIPh7B7XRo6O5iKI92yYrux0gSVtIL7+63EqDuCtakerkAm65+yOJZ9Vw40Ammndkx8qsUY/4g57DMCrp0Nh1rJ2DtTK1LYgaVmfPPeli/5BVgU/cj2/Ss49uomaVgm3lYRiX5brDUtcLASMicUk7JnbrzgMV8yfTKdYrMNTrVlxWlAbF1GKKQoBgu8kng=","page_age":"2025-12-10T16:00:00+00:00","snippet":"Population in Iceland The population of Iceland was 0.4million in 2024, compared to 0.3 a decade earlier. ... 2021 | 2022 | 2023 | 2024 | 2025","site_name":"FocusEconomics","site_icon":"https://cdn.deepseek.com/site-icons/focus-economics.com"},{"type":"web_search_result","title":"Iceland Total population 2026 - Total population in Iceland (1975 - 2026)","url":"https://geofactbook.com/countries/iceland/total-population#1","encrypted_content":"piBqRPae05SGkdIEUdgS4hwlOrB2ElKM8ICcK5H4e3DrAtKDQgQ2ySk4nsnMRMwc3ShfAzgQgLxOlDVJhOsWrRs1uciTXXXF4HeW7r3YGLB+Q9u2ftDxxE+LM0yhvz7w0W2VqN4BjSZeLVWJC6MRrJyWxFZrDkVrrBImb/c=","page_age":"2025-10-28T16:00:00+00:00","snippet":"2025 | 398.27K persons | +4.87K persons | +1.24% 2024 | 393.40K persons | +5.84K persons | +1.51%","site_name":"geofactbook.com","site_icon":"https://cdn.deepseek.com/site-icons/geofactbook.com"},{"type":"web_search_result","title":"Iceland Population 2026: Facts & Rankings",